gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Hi! Sorry to keep you waiting!\p"
	.string "Welcome to the Outer Rim, a galaxy\n"
	.string "full of COMPANIONS!\p"
	.string "My name is KORR.\p"
	.string "But everyone calls me the COMPANION\n"
	.string "PROFESSOR.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This is what we call a “COMPANION.”\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "Every world out here is home to\n"
	.string "beasts, beings and droids we call\l"
	.string "COMPANIONS.\p"
	.string "People live alongside COMPANIONS,\n"
	.string "at times as friendly companions, and\l"
	.string "at times as hard-working partners.\p"
	.string "And sometimes, we team up with them\n"
	.string "and battle others like us.\p"
	.string "But for all that, we still don't\n"
	.string "know everything about COMPANIONS.\p"
	.string "In fact, there are many, many\n"
	.string "secrets surrounding them.\p"
	.string "To unravel those mysteries,\n"
	.string "I study them on every world I can.\l"
	.string "That's what I do.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And you are?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy?\n"
	.string "Or are you a girl?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "All right.\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Ah, okay!\p"
	.string "You're {PLAYER}{KUN}, whose family\n"
	.string "is landing at MOS PELGO.\l"
	.string "I get it now!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "All right, are you ready?\p"
	.string "Your very own adventure is about\n"
	.string "to unfold.\p"
	.string "Take courage, and leap out into a\n"
	.string "galaxy where dreams, adventure,\l"
	.string "and friendships await!\p"
	.string "Well, I'll be expecting you later.\n"
	.string "Come see me in my COMPANION LAB.\p"
	.string "$"
